Query convention: always getByRole("button", { name: ... }) / queryAllByRole("button", { name: /^Join/ }). NEVER a class-substring query for the join control. The cards themselves are role="button", so a bare screen.getByRole("button") is ambiguous on a card that has a conference. The two existing bare-getByRole("button") call sites render events with NO conference - do not add a conference to those events.

